    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d314-f1" n="54" xml:id="d314-f1-content">
                <p>“You are requested to report from time to time on the progress of your
                    conversations with the Haitian Government on the various matters pending at this
                    time. The Department desires especially to be informed as to the status of
                    currency reform, the budget and the protocol.” (File No. 833.51/855a.)</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d314-f2" n="55" xml:id="d314-f2-content">
                <p>The laws of sanction are not printed.</p>
            </note>
